  "name": "Apartment rental offers in Germany",
  "alternateName": "immo_data",
  "description": "268,850 apartment rental listings scraped from ImmoScout24, Germany's largest real estate platform, at four points in time between September 2018 and February 2020. Each row is one listing with rent and cost figures, size, location (federal state to postcode), building characteristics, energy data, features and free-text descriptions (German). Contains rental offers only, no sales listings. A full data dictionary is provided as data_dictionary.csv.",
  "keywords": [
    "rental market",
    "apartment rentals",
    "housing",
    "rent prices",
    "real estate",
    "Germany",
    "ImmoScout24",
    "web scraping"
  ],
